{title: Teri Aahatein Nahi Hai}
{artist: Amit Trivedi Karthik}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Choti choti [C]baatein,        [G]yunhi aate [C]jaate
[G]Yaadein [C]sehlaake,        Jaati [F]hain
[G]Raaton ko [C]sirhaane,        [G]Baasi [C]muskaane
[G]Mujhko [C]sulaake,        Jaati [F]hai
[C]Milna nahin hai [Am]mumkin,        Itna batao [F]lekin
Hum phir mile kyun [D]hain... [G],        [C]Tujhko bhulaana [Am]paaun
Tujhko bhulaana [F]paaun,        Yeh silsile kyun [D]hain... [G]
