Phir bhi gile kyun [D]hain... [G],        [C]Tujhko bhulaana [Am]paaun
Tujhko bhulaana [F]paaun,        Yeh silsile kyun [D]hain... [G]
Sab kuch [C]wahi hai,        Par kuch [Am]kami hai
Teri [F]aahatein nahin [G]hai,        Sab kuch [C]wahi hai
Par kuch [Am]kami hai,        Teri [F]aahatein nahin [G]hai
